<title>USA: UtiliCorp offers to buy 10.5 pct notes.</title>
<headline>UtiliCorp offers to buy 10.5 pct notes.</headline>
<dateline>KANSAS CITY, Mo. 1997-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>UtiliCorp United Inc said Monday it is offering to purchase any and all of the $125 million of its outstanding 10.5 percent senior notes due December 1, 2020.</p>
<p>Morgan Stanley &amp; Co Inc is the exclusive dealer manager for this tender offer, which expires on March 31, 1997 unless extended by UtiliCorp United.</p>
<p>Shares of UtiliCorp United, a $4.7 billion international energy company, closed at 26 unchanged from Friday's close.</p>
<p>		  ((Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8787))</p>
</text>
